        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>72 Inch Rectangular Mitered Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rectangular Mitered Pull has 6 feet center to centers. This extra long door pull comes at a very reasonable price. The 72 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Rectangular Door Pull is available with mounting kits for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors to it is easy to install in both residential as well as commercial applications. Choose from a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-18T72FB-spc.gif?v=1704354688\" width=\"600\" height=\"159\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-CAN18T72FB-32D Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-rectangular-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>24\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/36-inch-rectangular-satin-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>36\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-stainless-steel-48-inch-rectangular-pull\"><b>48\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/rectangular-60-inch-mitered-stainless-steel-pull\"><b>60\" Rectangular Stainless Steel Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 72\" Stainless Steel Rectangular Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: <b>304 Stainless Steel Tubing</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 72\" (1828.8 mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 73\" (1854 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-5/8\" (66.7 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-5/8\" (92 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Width: 1\" (25.4 mm) x 1-1/2\" (38.1 mm)</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Limited quantities available.</b> <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact us</b></a> for more information.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "72 Inch Satin Stainless Steel Rectangular Door Pull",
